---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CTA from "../components/CTA.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Features | Cleanmail" description="The mail and events that matter, sorted, and already on your calendar.">
  <section class="features-show">
    <p class="eyebrow">Features</p>
    <h1 class="show-title">Just what you <span class="pop">need</span>. Nothing you don't.</h1>
    <p class="show-sub">No feature dump. No 30-day grid to squint at. Here is the short list of things Cleanmail&trade; does, and does well.</p>

    <div class="marquee">
      <p class="mq-kicker">The whole point</p>
      <h2 class="mq-title">Sorted by <span class="pop">person</span>, not by sender.</h2>
      <p class="mq-body">Cleanmail sorts the school, camp, and activity mail by the people you care about, then breaks each thread into short, plain-language snippets. You get your whole family's week at a glance, without reading a single full email. And your calendar stays yours: keep it private inside Cleanmail, or share it with your household so everyone sees the same schedule.</p>
      <div class="mq-flow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="6" width="17" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M4 7.5l8 6 8-6"/></svg>
        <svg class="mq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h14M13 7l5 5-5 5"/></svg>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="2.5"/><rect x="6.5" y="6.5" width="11" height="2.5" rx="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" opacity="0.28"/><path d="M6.5 12.5h7M6.5 16h9"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feat-grid">
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M3 8.5h18M7 3v3M17 3v3M7.5 12h1.5M11.2 12h1.6M15 12h1.5M7.5 16h1.5M11.2 16h1.6M15 16h1.5"/></svg></div><h3>Snap the whole month</h3><p>Every date lands on your calendar.</p></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-ic teal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="15" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3.5 9.5h17M8 3.5v3M16 3.5v3"/><rect x="6" y="12.5" width="12" height="3" rx="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" opacity="0.28"/></svg></div><h3>Your weekly view</h3><p>The week ahead, not a month grid.</p></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8"/></svg></div><h3>Add anything</h3><p>Type, snap, upload, or say it.</p></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-ic teal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="15" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3.5 9.5h17"/><path d="M9 13l-2 2 2 2M15 19l2-2-2-2M7 15h10"/></svg></div><h3>Two-way calendar</h3><p>Syncs both ways with Google.</p></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3.8 19a5.2 5.2 0 0110.4 0"/><path d="M15.5 5.6a3 3 0 010 4.8"/><path d="M16.2 13.4a5.2 5.2 0 013.9 5.6"/></svg></div><h3>Your whole household</h3><p>Up to four share one digest.</p></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-ic teal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6.5 16.5V11a5.5 5.5 0 1111 0v5.5l1.5 2h-14l1.5-2z"/><path d="M10 20.5a2 2 0 004 0"/></svg></div><h3>Reminders</h3><p>Day before, morning of, or hour out.</p></div>
      <div class="feat"><div class="feat-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 15l6-6"/><path d="M10.8 6.6l1.6-1.6a4 4 0 015.6 5.6L16.4 12.2"/><path d="M13.2 17.4l-1.6 1.6a4 4 0 01-5.6-5.6L7.6 11.8"/></svg></div><h3>Multiple inboxes</h3><p>Up to three Gmail accounts, one place.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="more">
      <h2>A few more things</h2>
      <p class="more-sub">Small, but they earn their place.</p>
      <div class="more-list">
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Pinned events.</b> <span>Keep the big ones stuck to the top of your digest.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Smart senders.</b> <span>Name an activity and Cleanmail finds the senders that fit, groups a company's many addresses into one, and moves a sender to another person in a tap.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Voice edits.</b> <span>Already have an event? Change the time just by telling it to.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Tap straight through.</b> <span>Cards from your inbox link back to the email they came from, and any address opens in maps.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>It lands when it lands.</b> <span>New mail shows up in Cleanmail as it arrives, not in tomorrow's digest.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Changes, shown.</b> <span>When a school moves a date, the event updates and the old time stays crossed out underneath.</span></p></div>
        <div class="more-item"><svg class="chk" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7"/></svg><p><b>Searchable history.</b> <span>Past digests stay searchable for the detail you need weeks later.</span></p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="features-cta"><CTA /></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .features-show{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:54px 24px 96px}
  .features-show .eyebrow{text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--purple);margin:0 0 14px}
  .show-title{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,40px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-1px;color:var(--navy);margin:14px 0 10px}
  .show-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 auto 44px;max-width:560px}
  .pop{color:var(--orange)}

  .marquee{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(74,111,227,.09),rgba(93,196,184,.11));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:34px 30px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px}
  .mq-kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.4px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--teal);margin:0 0 10px}
  .mq-title{font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.6px;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 14px}
  .mq-body{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink);max-width:580px;margin:0 auto}
  .mq-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin-top:24px;color:var(--purple)}
  .mq-flow svg{width:46px;height:46px}
  .mq-flow .mq-arrow{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--muted)}

  .feat-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:18px}
  .feat{flex:0 1 calc(33.333% - 12px);min-width:210px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:30px 22px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(27,34,54,.05)}
  .feat-ic{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(74,111,227,.10);color:var(--purple);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px}
  .feat-ic.teal{background:rgba(93,196,184,.15);color:var(--teal)}
  .feat-ic svg{width:28px;height:28px}
  .feat h3{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 7px;letter-spacing:-.2px}
  .feat p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin:0}

  .more{margin-top:60px}
  .more h2{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(21px,2.6vw,27px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.5px;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 6px}
  .more-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 30px}
  .more-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px 30px}
  .more-item{display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start}
  .more-item .chk{width:19px;height:19px;color:var(--teal);flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px}
  .more-item p{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
  .more-item b{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600}
  .more-item span{color:var(--muted)}

  .features-cta{margin-top:60px}

  @media (max-width:820px){ .feat{flex:0 1 calc(50% - 9px)} }
  @media (max-width:640px){
    .more-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}
    .marquee{padding:28px 22px}
  }
  @media (max-width:520px){ .feat{flex:0 1 100%} }
</style>
